      47.85,
      460.69,
      537.87,
      519.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 of the State Industrial Corporation Act, No. 49 of 1957, I, RajithaSenaratne, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine with the approval of the Government by the CabinetDecision of 18/0769/718/043 of dated 10th April 2018, do, by this Order repeal the First Schedule to the Order madeunder Subsection (1) of the Section 2 of the aforesaid Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 456/21 dated 4thJune 1987 and substitute the following :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      257.49,
      532.69,
      328.29,
      543.76
    ],
    "text": "\u201cFirst Schedule",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      556.69,
      214.66,
      567.76
    ],
    "text": "The objects of the Corporation shall be :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      580.69,
      537.84,
      603.76
    ],
    "text": "(1) either by itselft or by entering into such Joint Venture, Public-Private Partnership or other such agreement tomanufacture, process, stock, pack or repack medicine ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      616.69,
      222.48,
      627.76
    ],
    "text": "(2) to create subsidiary companies ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      640.69,
      350.82,
      651.76
    ],
    "text": "(3) to enter into International Agreements with potential investors ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      664.69,
      428.9,
      675.76
    ],
    "text": "(4) to provide technical assistance for the manufacturing and processing of medicine ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      722.87,
      295.43,
      741.21
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A PG 4621\u2014 517 (08/2019)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
